# React + Chakra

- Chakra UI v2 + Emotion (not Tailwind)
- Theme tokens in `client/src/theme` (brand / ink / accent / canvas)
- Global atmosphere + shells in `styles.css`
- Form controls: reuse `components/ui/Field*` shells
- Light theme by default for the main app
- Destructive actions: inline confirm bubble, not modal/alert
- Prefer composition over giant page components
- Icons: `react-icons/fi`
